{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:261c8a67c12fa159","name":"Venom Assault Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-261c8a67c12fa159","title":"Venom Assault Armor","revision":20340,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:39:54Z","sha256":"42816de43b2ccfdef79db7eb628650e56830da76d512e713e9adbc4bd8d9b4e3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20340","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Venom%20Assault%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-261c8a67c12fa159","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Part Powered Armor, part ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armored Space Suit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armored_Space_Suit","referenceId":"reference:ded914aa240a7e3e"},", Venom Assault Armor provides ample protection from hostile attackers and environments. The wearer may survive up to 24 hours in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum","referenceId":"reference:f93faa368bc7aefa"}," of space or other hostile environmental conditions. Much like other Galactic Alliance uniforms and armor sets, the Venom Assault Armor has a dark blue and black color scheme and prominently features the Galactic Alliance logo on the shoulder pauldrons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, the wearer can activate the armor's limited jump jets as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to move at normal speed in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zero-Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zero-Gravity"},". The jets are not powerful enough to lift an armored trooper in normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gravity","referenceId":"reference:19602d23667cf93d"},". The suit also adds a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score. However, the wearer must have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Heavy)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Heavy)","referenceId":"reference:7773896a63cadb7f"}," feat to use either the jets or gain the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 17,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 38 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
